"""The tests of the dashboard `{{ d.name }}`: the value of each widget, from known records.

Each test stores records that pass the filter of the widget, and a record
that fails each path of the filter. It checks the value of the endpoint
on the database of the tests: Postgres, or SQLite.
"""

